<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 2.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 2.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Saturday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- Libyan leader Gaddafi ends five-day visit to Tunisia; bilateral cooperation increased.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Gaddafi says visit was successful, Arab Maghreb union must continue; gas pipeline to link Libya and Tunisia.</p>
</text>
